// Overrides against the nearest base declaration's declared contract (plan
// d.10, A:1356): a permission above the declared one, `move` unmatched, a
// read-only result for a writable one, and stores compared by `read_set_only <
// fields_only < whole` with the read bit (L:83, H36) are EN0615; a source outside
// the declared ones (the base's plus `this`) is EN0714; storing or writing less
// fits. `Cursor` writes through its fields and says `implements Copy`: EN0418.
// MIR shapes: a field write through `this` (plan c.4, plan.md:913).
class Lexer {
  src: &string;
}
